--TEST--
Two fields of one derived class with the same wire key are `E0873` at the second, whether the key is the property's name or a `name:` override
--FILE--
<?nvs
#[Core\Json\Derive]
class Order {
    public function constructor(
        public int $total,
        #[Core\Json\Field(name: "total")]
        public int $sum,
        #[Core\Json\Field(name: "id")]
        public int $first,
        #[Core\Json\Field(name: "id")]
        public int $second,
    ) {}
}

echo "unreachable\n";
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0873]: two fields have the key `total`
  --> case.nvs:5:20
%A
error[E0873]: two fields have the key `id`
   --> case.nvs:9:20
%A
error: aborting due to 2 errors
To read what a code means and how to fix it, run `nvs agent show <code>`.
